 "remarks": "Welcome to 59 Clinton Avenue, a beautifully maintained side-by-side two-family home in Norwalk's desirable Spring Hill neighborhood. This townhouse-style duplex offers modern living and strong income potential for investors and owner-occupants alike. Thoughtfully renovated just a few years ago, both residences feature updated kitchens and bathrooms, modern finishes, hardwood floors throughout, and spacious, functional layouts. Each residence offers an open-concept main level with a seamless flow between the kitchen and living area. Upstairs, three generously sized bedrooms and a full bathroom complete the second level. Unit A features 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a fully finished walkout lower level complete with a full bathroom, generating $4,400 in monthly rent. Unit B offers 3 bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, and a partially finished walkout basement, with projected monthly rental income of $4,000. Both units include in-unit laundry, central heating and air conditioning, and separately metered utilities. Set on 0.19 acres, the property features five dedicated parking spaces, a private backyard, and individual rear decks off the main living areas. Minutes from The SoNo Collection, South Norwalk Metro-North, shopping, dining, I-95, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway. Whether expanding your portfolio or living in one unit while renting the other, this turnkey property offers flexibility and long-term value.",
